      <title>华为2026上半年营收4678亿增9.55% 净利润下滑至234亿</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260831/%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%BA2026%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%8A%E5%B9%B4%E8%90%A5%E6%94%B64678%E4%BA%BF%E5%A2%9E9.55-%E5%87%80%E5%88%A9%E6%B6%A6%E4%B8%8B%E6%BB%91%E8%87%B3234%E4%BA%BF/</link>
